Legion KVM

The main Rust workspace includes the Legion CPU compatibility implementation,
licensed under GNU AGPL version 3. Its existing license and copyright notice
are retained in LICENSE and crates/cpu-contract/LICENSE.

The NVIDIA backend contains components under Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause and
GPL-2.0-or-later. The original license texts are retained in backends/nvidia.
Its guest driver retains its GPL-2.0 SPDX identifier.

The guest CPU module is GPL-2.0. Changes to Linux and QEMU are distributed
under the corresponding upstream licenses. Runtime images may include other
components; their source notices must accompany redistributed runtime images.

Cargo dependency licenses are declared by their respective packages.
